    /usr/lib/R/site-library/lobstr/libs/lobstr.so: undefined symbol: SET_GROWABLE_BIT
  Execution halted
  root@unstable_docker:~$ 

'SET_GROWABLE_BIT' is one of those accessors now outlawd.

